<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE CLOSE: TURNOVER HITS RECORD, UHIS GAINS.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLOSE: TURNOVER HITS RECORD, UHIS GAINS.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Preliminary closing data show bourse turnover at record</p>
<p>184.3 million kroons compared to the previous record of 178.8</p>
<p>million kroons from July 16.</p>
<p>* Index down 1.06 percent to 338.63.</p>
<p>* Hansapank was most traded with 45.9 million</p>
<p>kroons to fall 4.47 kroons to 188.41 kroons.</p>
<p>* Hoiupank falls 4.96 kroons to 191.54 kroons in</p>
<p>trade of 36.7 million kroons.</p>
<p>* Uhispank turnover 41.4 million kroons, up 4.05</p>
<p>kroons to 68.30 kroons.</p>
<p>* On the free market, Norma traded 14.6 million</p>
<p>kroons to lose 0.38 kroons to 87.62 kroons.</p>
<p>(See http://www.tse.ee/online/total.htm for market data)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
</text>
